{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to travel through dangerous levels where countless threats await you! Each level is a maze of paths, and you'll have to move carefully, step by step, dodging traps and solving puzzles.: Fight enemies face to face or avoid them. What is your main goal? Complete each level without loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the fight for survival, weapons are your key ally. Find it and use it wisely, but remember: any weapon has limited durability. Keep an eye on the condition of your equipment \u2014 a worn-out blade can break in the midst of a battle. Shields are also vital for protection, fending off enemy attacks. Look for power-ups to restore the strength of shields and weapons, because without them, your defense can fail at a critical moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will chase you relentlessly, and everyone has their own abilities and tactics. While they're hunting you, remember: the best strategy is cunning and quick decisions. Skillful maneuvers will help you outplay even the strongest opponents. If a collision can be avoided, consider running away. Sometimes that's what will save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting challenge where every step can be your last. Be careful, act wisely, and you may be able to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LEVEL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768110/159815e71e2e3e83d67d1cefbec67549177d411f.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768110/b332761e7fb9b8d26a0d5b255692f0d4f799b7c4.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768110/779937d4b9c9e3774a2eac7d1399c942011f97c3.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3768110/0aef7e2053b7ccc750d1900bfba8f5f7eec74